---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { kofiUrl, showDonate } from "../site";
---

<Base
  title="Privacy"
  description="What Visa Slot Notifier stores, and what it never asks for."
>
  <main class="section prose">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p>
        This service reports appointment dates. It is not a place to enter a visa
        application.
      </p>
      <h2>What we store</h2>
      <ul class="steps">
        <li>A reported opening: post, visa class, OFC or consular, and the date.</li>
        <li>A random id for the browser that sent the report, used to limit floods.</li>
        <li>Your Telegram chat id and the filters you choose, so we know where to send a match.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>What we never ask for</h2>
      <ul class="steps">
        <li>Visa-site usernames, passwords, or security answers.</li>
        <li>Passport numbers, payment cards, or application answers.</li>
        <li>Screenshots of the scheduling page.</li>
      </ul>
      {
        showDonate && (
          <p>
            Donations happen on <a href={kofiUrl}>Ko-fi</a>. We do not receive your card
            number. Ko-fi handles that payment under its own policy.
          </p>
        )
      }
      <p>
        Telegram delivers the alert. Once a chat id is stored, it is used only to
        send matching openings and to remember your filters.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>
